# Defossilize ({4}{B} sorcery): "Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature explores, then it explores again." Dead Weight kills Bot1's Memnite on turn 1; on
# turn 3 Defossilize brings it back and it explores twice (CR 701.44a): the first reveals Forest, a land, which goes to the hand and puts no counter on it; the second reveals Lightning Bolt, a nonland,
# so the Memnite gets a +1/+1 counter (2/2, so the second explore did happen after the first, on the returned object) and Bot1 puts the Bolt into the graveyard.
